WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:08.350
Us humans are like ships, lost in the ocean
of life.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:14.269
We seek stable land and hope for guidance
from the ocean’s current, only to have it

00:00:14.269 --> 00:00:18.460
carry us on its own uncertain course.

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:25.250
This often brings us towards feelings of helplessness
and confusion, and causes us to desire to

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.910
give up control as the captain of our ship.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:37.160
We look for someone or something to give us
a break from the difficulty of navigating.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:44.090
This relief often comes in the form of intoxicating
substances.

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:50.530
Intoxicating substances allude to being worthy
captains of our ship, but their destination

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:58.010
is often limited to the shores of their own
abuse.

00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:02.350
The greatest hardship of life is life itself.

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:07.860
We are in constant battle against its complexities
and illusions.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:14.140
When we don’t take the necessary steps to
deal with such complexities and illusions,

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.210
we are forced to dwell on them.

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:23.490
Dwelling on the difficulties of life forms
knots in the wiring of our brain.

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:30.700
Just like a knot in a muscle, these knots
restrict our range of mental motion and inhibit

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:34.290
a healthy operation of life.

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:40.070
In our efforts to loosen and alleviate these
knots, we often find our self at the foot

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:43.720
of intoxicating substances.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:51.060
But the end of the rope that they pull usually
only further tightens them.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:57.650
Humans are one of the only creatures on planet
earth to purposely form habit out of altering

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.920
their own brain.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:07.030
This is likely a product of the complex maze
that exists between our self and the world.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:12.130
And drugs create an illusion of smoothness.

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:19.640
Using pleasure-stimulating and mind altering
substances is not always harmful.

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:26.440
But the problem is our inability to understand
how to sometimes create this same smoothness

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:28.750
in life on our own.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:35.980
It is this that causes the misuse and overuse
of intoxicating substances and it is this

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:38.910
that we must be concerned about.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:43.500
People are not accomplices to the crime of
drug abuse.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:49.989
People are victims of life’s complexity
and mortality, and drugs are merely a byproduct.

00:02:49.989 --> 00:02:51.569
A person who is fulfilled, need not form habit
out of leaving their mind.

00:02:51.569 --> 00:02:57.390
And as a culture, we must understand and be
compassionate towards this.

00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:03.550
In order to understand how to appropriately
handle substance abuse problems, we must first

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:07.810
make sure we are appropriately handling human
ones.

